{"id": "x0131", "pool": "easy-fact", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The name of the nymph who fell in love with Narc issus was Echo. According to Greek myth ology, E cho was a nymph known for her ability to repeat words spoken by others. She became deeply enamored with Narcissus, but when he rejected her affection, she pined away until only her voice remained behind.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
