{"id": "x0195", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "To run Spark on a cluster, you can use the spark-s ubmit command. This command allows you to submit your application to the cluster manager of your choice, such as Mes os or YARN. You would typically specify the path to your Spark application file and any necessary options like the master URL or cluster configuration. For example, you might run something like spark- submit -- master yarn app. jar your-application. jar. This will submit your job to the YARN cluster for execution.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0203", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, there are a few things you can do to help improve your sleep quality. First of all, try to establish a consistent bedtime routine that helps signal to your body that it's time to wind down for the night. This might include activities like reading a book, taking a warm bath, or practicing relaxation techniques such as deep breathing or meditation. It' s also important to limit exposure to screens before bed, as the blue light emitted by devices can interfere with melatonin production, which is essential for regulating sleep-w ake cycles. Additionally, ensure that your sleeping environment is comfortable and conducive to restful sleep. This means keeping the room cool, dark, and quiet, and using a mattress and pillow that provide adequate support for your body. Finally, avoid consuming ca ffeine or heavy meals close to bedtime, as these can disrupt your ability to fall asleep easily.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 43, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0211", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "When you meditate, your mind quiets down and focus es on the present moment. You might focus on your breath, a sound, or just simply being aware of how you feel. It helps reduce stress, calm your thoughts, and improve your sense of well-being over time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0219", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, I can help with that. When buying a bicycle, there are several key factors to consider. First, think about your intended use. Are you planning to ride for commuting, sport s, or leisure? This will influence the type of bike you choose. For example, road bikes are designed for speed and efficiency on paved surface s, while mountain bike s are better suited for off-road terrain. Next, consider the size and fit of the bike. It's important to find a frame that matches your height so you can reach the ground easily when stopped and have comfortable leg extension. Many bike shop s offer size guide s or fitting services, which can be helpful. The quality of components is also important. Look for reliable brakes, gears, and tires. Disc brake s, for instance, offer better stopping power in various conditions. Additionally, check the build quality of the frame and ensure it is made from durable material s like aluminum or steel. If you plan to carry items, make sure the bike has rack s or panniers mount s. Also, consider safety features such as lights and reflect ors, especially if you'll be riding at night. Lastly, test ride the bike whenever possible.", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0227", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Roman Empire was founded in 27 B C, when Oct avian became the first Roman Emperor.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0235", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I wake up at 6:3 0 a.m. and spend the first hour of my day doing something that' s just for me, whether it be reading or journal ing or medit ating or going for a walk.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0243", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "One of my favorite games to play with family is called Codenames. It's a word- based game where you have to guess words based on one-word clue s given by your team mate. Another fun option is Settlers of Catan, which involves building roads and settlements on an island. Both games are great for bringing everyone together and creating some memorable moments!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0251", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A genome-wide association study, or GWAS for short, is a research method used to find genetic variations that are associated with specific traits or diseases. Scientists collect DNA samples from many individuals, usually thousands or more, and analyze millions of genetic markers across the entire genome to see if any particular variation s are more common in people with a certain condition compared to those without it. For example, a GWAS might look at whether a specific gene variant is linked to type 2 diabetes by comparing people with the disease to healthy controls.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 32, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0259", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Contemporary dance is a style of dance that emerged in the 20 th century, blending elements from modern dance and other forms like ballet, jazz, and even street dance. It focuses on expressing emotion s and ideas through movement rather than strict technical rule s. Dancers often use fluid, expressive motion s, combining strength with grace, and it can be performed to music or silence. The style is highly versatile and allows for personal interpretation, making each performance unique.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0267", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It depends on the rules of the tournament. In professional golf today, players are allowed up to 14 clubs in their bag. That includes driver, fairway wood s, irons, and putter. Some might carry fewer for simplicity or personal preference.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
