{"id": "x0283", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Discrete manufacturing is the process of creating products that are made up of individual parts or components, like cars, electronic s, or furniture. These items are assembled from separate pieces rather than being formed continuously, which is what you see in processes like making steel ingots or continuous flow production. Each part is usually designed and produced separately before being put together to form the final product. It ’s common in industries where customization or assembly of complex systems is needed.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0291", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, there are a lot of popular tropical travel destinations for people on the East Coast of the United States. Some of the most popular ones include the Caribbean islands such as the Bahamas, Jamaica, and the U tron Islands. These places offer beautiful beaches, warm weather, and plenty of opportunities for sun bathing, swimming, and other water activities. Other popular destination s include Hawaii, Mexico, and the Caribbean islands.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0299", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The best way to brew an espresso is to use fresh, high- quality coffee beans, grind them just before brewing, and use a well-maintained e spresso machine with the right amount of water pressure and temperature. Start by filling the portaf ilter with ground coffee, t amp it firmly, and lock it into the machine. Then, pressurize the system and let the water extract the coffee for about 2 5 to 30 seconds, producing a shot that should be rich, aromatic, and have a thick cre ma on top.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 34, "carrier_ended": null}
